      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: What? Snowing? I have to go take a look."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：下雪有什么好看的？",
      "traditional": "本：下雪有什麼好看的？",
      "pinyin": "běn xià xuě yǒu shén me hǎo kàn de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: What is there to see about snow?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：哇！！！真的下雪了！这是我第一次看到雪！太美了！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：哇！！！真的下雪了！這是我第一次看到雪！太美了！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wā zhēn de xià xuě le zhè shì wǒ dì yī cì kàn dào xuě tài měi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Wow!!! It's really snowing! This is the first time I see snow! It's so beautiful!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：第一次？你们那儿不下雪吗？",
      "traditional": "本：第一次？你們那兒不下雪嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn dì yī cì nǐ men nà'r bú xià xuě ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: The first time? You don't have snow where you're from?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我家在南方，我们那儿不下雪。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我家在南方，我們那兒不下雪。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ jiā zài nán fāng wǒ men nà'r bú xià xuě",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: My home is in the south. It doesn't snow over there."
    }
  ],
